  "extractionNotes": "Employee (0110 since 2011-05-01). Triplets: one stillborn (registry extract with the stillbirth annotation) and two live-born; a Za życiem certificate for one child (which child is not recorded; assigned to child-2). Maternity 2024-05-13..2024-12-15 = 217 days (31 weeks; the stillborn child counts), applied for alone (application 2024-05-15, full-use box not ticked), so 100%. Parental claimed separately: 56 weeks 2024-12-16..2026-01-11 extended for work at 1/2 time to 2027-02-07 (another 56 weeks), with the extended part also combined with work (employer remark and leave applications), so a separate parental claim at 70%. ZUS register: 1240 from 2024-05-13 and again from 2024-12-16. Grant evidenced by the file label (granting decision); decision text and salary tables not legible."
